The register names the panel, records conflicts, shows every score and marks
who restored or removed an application. It cannot retrospectively make a bad
competition good. It can make the next grant programme much harder to edit by
telephone.

The work is almost comically unfit for the final campaign weekend. It is also
the first decision here that will still exist when the next ministry discovers
another cabinet full of grant contracts.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the register online

