= 4 April 2024 — Educational infrastructure with bedrooms

The Education Ministry says audits of the programme commonly called **Willa
Plus** have already recovered nearly **PLN 3.5 million** and are seeking almost
**PLN 3.2 million** more. The full programme transferred PLN 40 million to
organisations for property and infrastructure; prosecutors opened an inquiry
in February into possible abuse of authority by ministry officials.

An audit request is not a conviction and a grant for a building is not suspect
merely because the building photographs well. The political mechanism is
nevertheless brutal: public education competes for repairs while favoured
organisations receive real estate whose contractual use now has to be checked
one property at a time.

[? if willa_grant_prepared = 1: The NCBR file already forced us to build a
grant trail. Willa Plus is the first chance to prove that was infrastructure,
not election-week décor.?][? if willa_grant_prepared = 0: We treated the last
grant scandal as a single institution or a single graphic. The same missing
register has now reappeared with gates, roofs and excellent drone footage.?]

- @willa_recover
- @willa_register
- @willa_keys_attack

