The NCBR expert trail grows a property column: recipient, beneficial owner,
selection score, contract, mortgage, promised public use and every repayment.
It is much harder to sell as a new scandal because it is recognisably the same
piece of administrative plumbing.

That is the point. The next ministry cannot say its grants are too specialised
for the public to follow without first explaining why a laboratory and a villa
fit on the same page.

