Counterparty, beneficial owner, competing offers, negative CBA advice,
advance, delivery and final recipient appear on one line. The register does not
decide criminal liability; it decides whether an emergency exception can
remain invisible after it is used.

The work lands because it was either prepared four years ago or visibly was
not. Voters receive a rare political callback in which paperwork is the reveal.

