Major asset sales must publish independent valuations, the price against each
valuation, strategic vetoes, off-take rights and the ministerial approval. A
board may still choose a lower price, but the exception arrives before the
signature and owns a named minister.

The rule cannot reverse a completed merger. It does ensure the next synergy
projection has to stand beside the rights surrendered to obtain it.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the rule before the Treasury

