The 2024 fields accept coal without modification: vendor, rejected advice,
contract, specification, sample, laboratory and storage site. The player does
not have to promise a new inquiry because the earlier decision already created
the place where this evidence belongs.

That continuity is the political reward. Four years of apparently dull choices
become one screen the public can finally read.

- @poland_event_queue: Release the matched ledger

@rars_coal_case
