The case separates the officials who approved the offer, suppliers who made
representations, people who sampled the coal and ministers who set the reserve
decision. Not every bad tonne requires the same offence or the same defendant.

Television dislikes the distinction. A court will require it.

- @poland_event_queue: Protect the coal file

