Q.clean_air_response_2026 = "Household-to-claim register";
Q.kpo_scrutiny += 10;
Q.climate_state_capacity += 4;
Q.media_capacity += 3;
Q.eu_relations += 3;
Q.public_trust += 6;
Q.institutional_trust += 6;
Q.left_poll_momentum += 0.4;
Q.public_mood_pending_rule_of_law_left_ownership += 7;
Q.news_headline =
    "Czyste Powietrze gains a household-to-installer-to-EU-claim register";
!}

The public record separates the household, installer, equipment, inspection,
payment, investigation flag and European declaration. Fraud investigations can
advance without turning every beneficiary into a suspect or every compliant
invoice into collateral damage.

If HoReCa already produced the data model, this is continuity. If not, the
player pays now for treating a previous EU-fund scandal as a prop.

- @poland_event_queue: Publish the claim chain

@clean_air_blame
title: Call the whole programme a PiS contamination zone
subtitle: A strong opposition swing and a dangerous government alibi: the investigated period crosses cabinets and the certification failure is current.
on-arrival: clean_air_response_2026 = "PiS contamination attack"; media_capacity += 6; left_poll_momentum += 0.75 if left_in_government = 0; left_poll_momentum -= 0.35 if left_in_government = 1; pis_poll_momentum -= 0.65; konf_poll_momentum += 0.15; ko_poll_momentum -= 0.15 if left_in_government = 1; p2050_poll_momentum -= 0.3 if left_in_government = 1; climate_state_capacity -= 3; kpo_public_credit -= 3; public_trust -= 2; institutional_trust -= 3; public_mood_pending_rule_of_law_backlash += 8; news_headline = "Czyste Powietrze becomes a national contamination-zone attack"

The line attaches every questioned invoice to the government that designed the
earlier stages. In opposition it moves polls immediately. Inside the cabinet it
sounds like an admission that two years were insufficient to find expenditure
the current ministry could not certify.

Households waiting for insulation hear that their entire programme is dirty.
PiS loses points; trust in the repair loses some with it.

- @poland_event_queue: Mark the contamination zone

